# The repository root IS the site, so everything here would otherwise be
# published. Keep the deployment to what a visitor should be able to reach.
#
# This list got shorter on 11.9.2026: everything that is kept but never served
# now lives under exactly two folders, so a new internal file is excluded by
# where it is put rather than by remembering to add a line here.
# tools/verify_site.mjs asserts that both are 404 on the deployed site.

# archive/site-apache  - the site that was live on the Apache webspace until the
#                        move to Vercel. It is the SOURCE OF RECORD for the
#                        reviewed legal wording (tools/build_legal.py reads it)
#                        and for the old contact page, so it stays in the
#                        repository - but it must not be reachable, or a search
#                        engine finds a second, older copy of the same company.
# archive/site-v3      - the site that was live until the 2026 relaunch, moved
#                        here with `git mv` so the history follows. Same reason.
archive/

# Internal: the audit findings, the design notes, the parked experiments, the
# screen recordings and source material. Kept, never served.
internal/

# Build and audit tooling, the local measuring server, and the session notes.
tools/
prodserve.py
HANDOFF.md
CHANGELOG.md
AGENTS.md

# The Claude Design export the site is BUILT FROM. 4.2 MB of source, and it
# contains a second copy of every headline on the start page - shipping it would
# put the studio in competition with itself in the index. robots.txt disallows
# it as a second line of defence; this is the first.
mccain-design-system/

# Source material and screen recordings - large and never requested by a page.
*.mp4

# Local tooling state.
.mind/
.mcp.json
.recall/
node_modules/
